OL,3,GNEWSAAffordable homes change dubbed 'a
OL,4,Adangerous game'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council has been accused of "playing
OL,7,Fa dangerous game" after amending plans
OL,8,Fto redevelop a council estate to secure
OL,9,Ffunding from the government.
OL,11,FThe majority of properties on
OL,12,FCambridge's Ekin Road are set to be
OL,13,Fdemolished and replaced, with most now
OL,14,Flying empty.
OL,16,FPlans submitted in January outlined
OL,17,Fthat the 91 council homes would be
OL,18,Freplaced with 78 on the estate, with a
OL,19,Ffurther 120 built on the nearby East
OL,20,FBarnwell scheme on Newmarket Road.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
