OL,3,GNEWSAAffordable homes change dubbed 'a
OL,4,Adangerous game'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut residents were told the plans had
OL,7,Fbeen amended after a "viability
OL,8,Fassessment" found it would not be
OL,9,Ffinancially viable to build 40% social
OL,10,Fhomes on the Ekin Road scheme. It was
OL,11,Finstead requested this be reduced to 20
OL,12,Faffordable homes - or 15%.
